    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Dear Terrence,<div><br></div><div>Thanks a lot for your comment, that makes a lot of sense to me and is very useful!</div><div><br></div><div>All the best,</div><div>Tabea</div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><br><br>On Tuesday, August 9, 2016 at 12:49:08 PM UTC+1, Tabea Schoeler wrote:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n\t\r\n\t\r\n\t\r\n\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0in;line-height:100%\"><font size=\"2\" face=\"arial, sans-serif\">Hello all,</font></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0in;line-height:100%\"><font size=\"2\" face=\"arial, sans-serif\"><br>\r\n\r\n</font></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0in;line-height:100%\"><font size=\"2\" face=\"arial, sans-serif\">I have the following\r\nreciprocal panel model, in which I want to get an estimate for\r\ncorrelated exogenous variables (<span lang=\"en-AU\">relapse_Y1\r\n~~ can_Y1</span>), the two autoregressive paths (<span lang=\"en-AU\">relapse_Y1\r\npredicts relapse_Y2 and can_Y1 predicts can_Y2) and the reciprocal\r\neffects between relapse_Y2 and can_Y2. Two covariates are controlled\r\nfor (meds, drugs).</span></font></p>\r\n<p lang=\"en-AU\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;line-height:100%\"><font size=\"2\" face=\"arial, sans-serif\"><br>\r\n\r\n</font></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0in;line-height:100%\"><font size=\"2\" face=\"arial, sans-serif\">M2 &lt;- &#39;</font></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0in;line-height:100%\"><font size=\"2\" face=\"arial, sans-serif\">    # Lagged path</font></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0in;line-height:100%\"><font size=\"2\" face=\"arial, sans-serif\">      can_Y2 ~\r\nrelapse_Y2 \r\n</font></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0in;line-height:100%\"><font size=\"2\" face=\"arial, sans-serif\">      relapse_Y2 ~\r\ncan_Y2</font></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0in;line-height:100%\"><font size=\"2\" face=\"arial, sans-serif\">    # Autoregressive\r\npath</font></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0in;line-height:100%\"><font size=\"2\" face=\"arial, sans-serif\">      can_Y2 ~\r\ncan_Y1 \r\n</font></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0in;line-height:100%\"><font si